HOW TO ATTACH VOLUMES TO CONTAINER
->To attach vol to container
docker run -itd --name cont-name --mount src=vol-name,destination=/ur_own_folder(data will store here) image
docker run -itd --name cont1 --mount src=mydata,destination=/kdevops ubuntu
NOTE - 1.we can attach vol to diff containers, if containers deleted also data will be available in volumes
2. we can create diff vol's to one container also
->to chk vol attached to cont or not
goto cont>give ll
docker exec -it cont-name bash
ll
